sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Browser
    participant W as Wallet (WalletConnect)
    participant R as Responder
    participant N as Node

    U->>U: quote from the live snapshot
    U->>W: make_offer(offered, requested, network fee)
    W-->>U: signed offer
    U->>R: POST the offer
    R->>N: is the recorded tip still unspent?
    R->>N: does its puzzle hash match what we think the pool is?
    R->>N: peak height
    R->>R: correct birth from the confirmed height
    R->>R: build the bundle around the offer
    R->>R: validate locally (no coin store: this cannot see UNKNOWN_UNSPENT)
    rect rgb(22, 48, 43)
        Note over R,N: INSIDE THE PUZZLE - everything above is off chain and holds no key
        R->>N: push_tx
        N->>N: the leaves run: prologue, exact brackets, the settlement<br/>binding, the finalizer recreating every reserve
        N-->>R: SUCCESS or PENDING
    end
    R->>R: persist the successor snapshot AHEAD of confirmation
    U->>N: poll the tip, not the index
